{"number":102,"name":"سُورَةُ التَّكَاثُرِ","englishName":"At-Takaathur","englishNameTranslation":"Competition","revelationType":"Meccan","numberOfAyahs":8,"hasBasmalaPrefix":false,"ayahs":[{"g":6169,"i":1,"ar":"أَلْهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","tr":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you","tl":"Al haaku mut takathur"},{"g":6170,"i":2,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","tr":"Until you visit the graveyards.","tl":"Hatta zurtumul-maqaabir"},{"g":6171,"i":3,"ar":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","tr":"No! You are going to know.","tl":"Kalla sawfa ta'lamoon"},{"g":6172,"i":4,"ar":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","tr":"Then no! You are going to know.","tl":"Thumma kalla sawfa ta'lamoon"},{"g":6173,"i":5,"ar":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","tr":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty...","tl":"Kalla law ta'lamoona 'ilmal yaqeen"},{"g":6174,"i":6,"ar":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","tr":"You will surely see the Hellfire.","tl":"Latara-wun nal jaheem"},{"g":6175,"i":7,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","tr":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.","tl":"Thumma latara wunnaha 'ainal yaqeen"},{"g":6176,"i":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","tr":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure.","tl":"Thumma latus alunna yauma-izin 'anin na'eem"}]}